('post', 'esthemax-catalog-2026', 0, '{"id":"esthemax-catalog-2026","title":"Esthemax Catalog 2026, Download","date":"2026-08-01","tag":"Catalog","cover":"assets/banners/menu-jars.jpg","excerpt":"The complete Esthemax professional catalog, every Hydrojelly formula, serum, cream and treatment-room essential, with sizes and full ingredient lists.","body":"<p>Browse or download the complete Esthemax professional catalog. Inside you will find the full Hydrojelly mask range, serums, innovation creams, cleansers, massage creams and spa essentials, each with exact sizes, key benefits and full ingredient lists.</p><p>Professional partners can use the catalog to build their treatment menus. For wholesale enquiries, reach us through the contact page.</p>","youtube":"","pdf":"assets/pdfs/esthemax-catalog-2026.pdf"}'::jsonb),
('post', 'how-hydrojelly-works', 1, '{"id":"how-hydrojelly-works","title":"Why Electrolytes? How a Hydrojelly Mask Works","date":"2026-08-15","tag":"Education","cover":"assets/banners/hero-jelly.jpg","excerpt":"Just drinking water is not enough. Here is what happens under a Hydrojelly mask, and why the jelly texture is more than a pretty moment.","body":"<p>Hydrojelly masks are infused with electrolytes to boost skin hydration, just drinking water is not enough. Each mask forms a vacuum-like seal that compresses facial contours, allowing complete absorption of organic nutrition and electrolytes into the deep layers of the skin.</p><p>The masks are formulated with refined algae, electrolytes and organic active ingredients to provide a unique silky texture that blankets the skin. This intensive facial compression allows nutrition from the mask, and from any serums still on the skin from the previous treatment step, to absorb fully.</p><p>The result is an instant cooling, soothing effect that helps firm, soothe and revitalize the skin for a natural, subtle glow.</p><h3>Mixed fresh, every time</h3><p>We prefer to avoid the chemicals and preservatives, like parabens, found in gel and liquid activators. Our dry powder formulas keep ingredients fresh while retaining all the natural benefits, every mask is simply activated with water, mixed fresh for each treatment.</p>","youtube":"","pdf":""}'::jsonb),
('post', 'hydrojelly-application-video', 2, '{"id":"hydrojelly-application-video","title":"Watch: The Hydrojelly Ritual, Step by Step","date":"2026-08-22","tag":"Video","cover":"assets/banners/why-hydrojelly.jpg","excerpt":"From powder to peel, watch how a Hydrojelly mask is mixed, applied and lifted away in one satisfying piece. (Sample video, replace with your own in the CMS.)","body":"<p>Watch the full ritual below: 1½ scoops of powder, one scoop of water, a swift mix into a cool silky jelly, applied generously over the face and neck, then peeled away in one piece after 15–20 minutes.</p><p><em>This is a sample video post. Open the CMS, edit this post and paste any YouTube link to replace it with your own footage.</em></p>","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7lc1UVf-VE","pdf":""}'::jsonb),
